  "name": "Garlic, Bacon, and Pickle Pizza",
  "subtitle": "A crisp, cheesy pizza with savory bacon and tangy dill pickles.",
  "description": "Garlic-brushed pizza crust layered with melted cheeses, bacon, pickle chips, red pepper flakes, and fresh dill.",
